    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor 8 is a multiplayer and single-player\u00a0horror game where you need to be attentive to not overlook any\u00a0anomalies on floors. Use the elevator to reach floor 1 and escape before monsters get you. When you miss an anomaly, elevator will glitch and take you back to the highest floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong>\u00a0You wake up in your apartment. A mysterious voice from a recorder tells you that you are trapped in a cursed building infested with anomalies and monsters. You need to escape by reaching floor 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYTIME:</strong>\u00a030 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose<strong> Exit 8 </strong>game mode -<strong>\u00a0</strong>press up when there's anomaly, press down when no anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.poster.avif?t=1743854410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.webm?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.mp4?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose<strong> Escape </strong>game mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>- remove anomalies by capturing them with your camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.poster.avif?t=1743854410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.webm?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.mp4?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:\u00a0</strong>Game modes can only be chosen when creating online room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short loop gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated into multiple languages</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse - Look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CTRL - Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift - Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RMB/LMB - Use Camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C - Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V - Voice Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Spectate</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floor 8 is a multiplayer and single-player\u00a0horror game where you need to be attentive to not overlook any\u00a0anomalies on floors. Use the elevator to reach floor 1 and escape before monsters get you. When you miss an anomaly, elevator will glitch and take you back to the highest floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong>\u00a0You wake up in your apartment. A mysterious voice from a recorder tells you that you are trapped in a cursed building infested with anomalies and monsters. You need to escape by reaching floor 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYTIME:</strong>\u00a030 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose<strong> Exit 8 </strong>game mode -<strong>\u00a0</strong>press up when there's anomaly, press down when no anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.poster.avif?t=1743854410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.webm?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/6e9c6059611d7f23a34b8da4afb765c0.mp4?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose<strong> Escape </strong>game mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>- remove anomalies by capturing them with your camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.poster.avif?t=1743854410\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.webm?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/5920fa2b902e2e0e41fb26d826fab122.mp4?t=1743854410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:\u00a0</strong>Game modes can only be chosen when creating online room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short loop gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated into multiple languages</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D - Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse - Look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CTRL - Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift - Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RMB/LMB - Use Camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C - Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V - Voice Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Spectate</p>",
